What about a ring of _visibility_?
Sometime, when I'm permanently invisible, and I want that a monster follows me
I feel my invisibility quite frustrating. Uh? Why I want a moster to follow me?
Well, a big monster is sometime impossible to carry on an altair to sacrifice,
so the only chance is to kill him just on it and becoming invisible in a shop
can be a major problem...

So I propose to create a ring of visibility.
The effects can be something like that:

- blessed
	You are visible		No effect. (well, no ideas)
	You are invisible	You become visible and gives you the change
				to make you permanently visible (any use of it?)

- normal
	You are visible		Monsters will know your position.
	You are invisible	You become visible.

- cursed
	You are visible		Monsters will know your position, and you cannot
				remove the ring! (as usual)
	You are invisible	Makes you permanently visible.
